      "id": "std.ram-16x4",
      "name": "16 \u00D7 4 RAM",
      "description": "Sixteen 4-bit words with asynchronous read and synchronous write. WE selects a write on the rising CLK edge. Every cell is a DFF and the read path is a mux tree.",
